      (@abi.doc "Uploads the caption or subtitle file to the endpoint for a specific BCP47 language.\nOne caption or subtitle file per language is allowed.\n\n* `language` - The BCP 47 language tag for the caption or subtitle.\n* `file` - The caption or subtitle file to upload.\n\nReturns: The created caption entry.\n\n## Errors\n\n* `NotFoundError` — if the video is not found\n* `BadRequestError` — if the language or file is invalid\n* `MaxFileSizeError` — if the file size is too large\n* `InternalError` — if an unexpected error occurs")
